  "text": "This look brings warmth and elegance to your first date at the park, blending a soft beige dress with a sheer sky-blue cardigan for a light autumn layer. The brown belt cinches your waist to highlight your natural curves, while the grey suede pumps add a touch of polish that balances the relaxed vibe. A woven beige bag finishes the ensemble, tying in your neutral base perfectly. It's an outfit that feels both effortless and put-together, just right for strolling through the park or sitting under a tree.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Tuck the hem of the striped top into the wide-leg trousers to keep your silhouette clean."
  ],
